{
    "title": "Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D",
    "description": "Welcome to Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D, you will have a chance to experience life of a cat, see the world through your sweet kitty's eyes, and have fun with all the perks and pitfalls in Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D\r\n\r\nYou have to choose the right family. Being a good cat or a naughty cat depends totally on your choice. Make up your mind!\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\nChoose and create your favorite cat.\r\nYou are free to make choices that affect the outcome of your cat\u2019s life.\r\nCare for your pet and make him happy.\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\nA variety of challenges and opportunities for your cat to explore.\r\nSmooth and addictive gameplay\r\nAwesome 3D graphic.\r\n\r\nIf you are a cat lover or just curious about what life is like as a cat, don't miss this game. Download Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D for FREE and start owning a 3D simulator cat now",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D, you will have a chance to experience life of a cat, see the world through your sweet kitty&#39;s eyes, and have fun with all the perks and pitfalls in Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D<br><br>You have to choose the right family. Being a good cat or a naughty cat depends totally on your choice. Make up your mind!<br><br>How to play:<br>Choose and create your favorite cat.<br>You are free to make choices that affect the outcome of your cat\u2019s life.<br>Care for your pet and make him happy.<br><br>Game Features:<br>A variety of challenges and opportunities for your cat to explore.<br>Smooth and addictive gameplay<br>Awesome 3D graphic.<br><br>If you are a cat lover or just curious about what life is like as a cat, don&#39;t miss this game. Download Cat Choices: Virtual Pet 3D for FREE and start owning a 3D simulator cat now",
